Silune brand assets
===================

The launcher icons, wordmark, and TV banner use a purple split-prism mark
on a charcoal (#25252D) icon field, paired with white lettering.
They do not incorporate the Silo logo or wordmark. SVG sources are in
branding/; scripts/generate-silune-branding.py renders the Android copies.

These Silune assets are licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later, like the
application's source code.

